WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Pictures of a table, bed and window feed a deep learning network. The diagram labels multi-level feature fusion and texture features, then shows identified glass, fabric and metal materials.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A second diagram connects identified materials to pathogen survivability, surface-to-hand transfer and hand-to-mucous transfer. Arrows lead to a suitable disinfection dosage.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The completed diagram links material recognition and surface infection risk with adapted disinfection procedures and dose. The Wiley and Hu and Li (2022) paper credits remain visible. This is an animated explanation of the framework, not a recorded robot experiment.
